}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xlorne","id":5245347,"login":"xlorne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDUzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/3a85b111632c8670f50517fdbb06f49b4196ddac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"message":"test: 大幅提升单元测试覆盖率（行覆盖 45% → 90%）\n\n- 新增/补全五个模块单元测试共约 300 个用例，均以 Java 8 兼容语法编写便于双分支同步：\n  starter（DTO/事件/事务/加密/本地 HttpServer REST 测试）、script（运行时/缓存/控制器）、\n  security（JWT/Redis 网关/过滤器/加解密）、data-fast（JDBC/动态 SQL/Map 视图）、\n  data-authorization（JDBC 代理链/列脱敏/SQL 分析）\n- 覆盖率：starter 51.8%→78.5%、script 64.5%→98.3%、security 68.8%→94.7%、\n  data-fast 32.9%→89.3%、data-authorization 28.5%→97.1%\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5e337a345a65040a59db4d272181c1b1a1b689e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/trees/d5e337a345a65040a59db4d272181c1b1a1b689e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/commits/3a85b111632c8670f50517fdbb06f49b4196ddac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5245347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/followers","following_url":"https