os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/ddc15f14f5516a2681c43fb60f21d483de15f8ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"message":"fix: 修复数据查询与请求解析的 6 个框架缺陷\n\n- FastRepository.findAll 非等值条件被 Example 静默降级为等值匹配：\n  新增 RequestFilter.isAllEqualFilter()，纯等值走 Example，复杂条件自动切换 HQL\n- ExampleBuilder 空 catch 吞异常导致过滤条件静默丢失，改为显式抛出 IllegalStateException\n- DynamicSQLBuilder 空 OR/AND 组合拼出非法 HQL（WHERE  AND），改为跳过空片段\n- SearchRequest.decode 对非法 Base64 抛 IllegalArgumentException 导致 500，改为按未消费参数处理\n- JdbcQuery.countQuery 参数数量相等时不拷贝导致 SQL 参数未绑定\n- JdbcQuery.CamelCaseRowMapper 未指定下划线分隔符导致驼峰转换失效\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"297415fdceb190990624436a280ee7c3571716e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/trees/297415fdceb190990624436a280ee7c3571716e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/commits/ddc15f14f5516a2681c43fb60f21d483de15f8ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5245347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xlorne","id":5245347,"login":"xlorne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDUzNDc=","organi