ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/99d5fbbf7a14f50c3efedd3c706a0fd2e56475e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:03Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"message":"docs: README 改为双版本线简介，文档全面对齐实际代码\n\n- README 仅保留 17.3.x（JDK 17/Spring Boot 3）与 8.2.x（JDK 8/Spring Boot 2）两条版本线简介，\n  移除前端框架版本章节，example/frontend 标注为示例工程\n- 新增 docs/example-guide.md 示例工程运行手册（启动、登录、API、可选配置、前端）\n- 修正文档与代码不符的内容：Relation 枚举名系统性错误、FieldChangeEvent→DomainChangeEvent、\n  SecurityLoginHandler 签名、Token.parseExtra、JoinConditionSQL 构造器、JdbcQuery 方法名、\n  findAll Example/HQL 行为描述等（含 docs/agents 镜像同步）\n- 新增 docs/wiki/springboot-starter-script.md，home.md 补齐 script 依赖与链接\n- CONTRIBUTING 更新 JDK 要求（17）、分支模型与构建指引\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"612dcda8013db3e29a92d61a6df47ed2b94ca14d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/trees/612dcda8013db3e29a92d61a6df47ed2b94ca14d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/commits/99d5fbbf7a14f50c3efedd3c706a0fd2e56475e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5245347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xlorne","id":5245347,"login":"xlorne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDUzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codingapi/springboot-framework/commit/99d5fbbf7a14f50c3efedd3c706a0fd2e56475e0","node_id":"C_kwDOF_ROqdoAKDk5ZDVmYmJmN2ExNGY1MGMzZWZlZGQzYzcwNmEwZmQyZTU2NDc1ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codingapi/springboot-framework/commit/c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8e","sha":"c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8e"}],"sha":"99d5fbbf7a14f50c3efedd3c706a0fd2e56475e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/99d5fbbf7a14f50c3efedd3c706a0fd2e56475e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5245347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xlorne","id":5245347,"login":"xlorne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDUzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/commits/c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:55:07Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:55:07Z","email":"1991wangliang@gmail.com","name":"lorne"},"message":"fix: 修复 data-fast 测试跨类数据泄漏导致的 CI 外键约束失败\n\nUserRepositoryTest 保存 user→profile→demo 外键链数据后从不清理，\n当测试类执行顺序使 UserRepositoryTest 先于 DemoRepositoryTest/\nJdbcQueryTest 运行时（执行顺序随 JDK 构建不同而变化，本地与 CI\n不一致），后者的 deleteAll 会因 PROFILE 表残留行触发外键约束冲突，\n导致 CI 间歇性失败。为 UserRepositoryTest 增加 @BeforeEach/@AfterEach\n按外键顺序（user→profile→demo）清理，使其完全自包含。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6644682d9d26a7faad4880178245514ccac47aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/trees/c6644682d9d26a7faad4880178245514ccac47aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codingapi/springboot-framework/git/commits/c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5245347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xlorne","id":5245347,"login":"xlorne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDUzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xlorne","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codingapi/springboot-framework/commit/c32873f27a6813b125f02b99c205f74ec21bab8