hError on failure.\n- The \"confirm in your wallet\" state shows only when the switch is still\n  unanswered after a second, so a silent switch shows nothing.\n- New WalletErrorReasonCode request_pending for EIP-1193 -32002.\n- Fuel switchChain rethrows instead of swallowing the failure.\n- ChangeNetworkButton is removed, including from\n  @layerswap/widget/internal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75410d985c8670206795479bf850eb63341b2db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/75410d985c8670206795479bf850eb63341b2db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/2463dd2b76cefc9b1aae008de669608467dd8fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6187131?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babgev","id":6187131,"login":"babgev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODcxMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babgev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/2463dd2b76cefc9b1aae008de669608467dd8fc5","node_id":"C_kwDOGCnBrtoAKDI0NjNkZDJiNzZjZWZjOWIxYWFlMDA4ZGU2Njk2MDg0NjdkZDhmYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapap