app/commits/aef92d6faec3db8a8efda7cb7064514127b5928d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:30:32Z","email":"aren@bransfer.io","name":"Aren"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:30:32Z","email":"aren@bransfer.io","name":"Aren"},"message":"feat: enhance deposit action polling with swap context integration\n\n- Introduced a new swap context to manage state and API interactions for deposit actions.\n- Updated deposit action polling tests to utilize the new swap context, ensuring accurate state management and polling behavior.\n- Enhanced the handling of approval transactions, allowing for partial approvals and retries without duplicating requests.\n- Improved the integration of SWR for data fetching, ensuring that requests are shared between components.\n- Added comprehensive tests for various scenarios involving approval transactions, including handling of pending and failed states.\n- Refactored existing tests to accommodate the new context and ensure consistent behavior across different workflows.","tree":{"sha":"130f91097daefd2f81071fc5f7469b0ee91d8571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/130f91097daefd2f81071fc5f7469b0ee91d8571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/aef92d6faec3db8a8efda7cb7064514127b5928d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101871962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arentant","id":101871962,"login":"arentant","node_id":"U_kgDOBhJxWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/aef92d6faec3db8a8efda7cb7064514127b5928d","node_id":"C_kwDOGCnBrtoAKGFlZjkyZDZmYWVjM2RiOGE4ZWZkYTdjYjcwNjQ1MTQxMjdiNTkyOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/795acf8aa8498ff2995bc267172cbfd2273f8980","sha":"795acf8aa8498ff2995bc267172cbfd2273f8980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/795acf8aa8498ff2995bc267172cbfd2273f8980"}],"sha":"aef92d6faec3db8a8efda7cb7064514127b5928d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/aef92d6faec3db8a8efda7cb7064514127b5928d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101871962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arentant","id":101871962,"login":"arentant","node_id":"U_kgDOBhJxWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/795acf8aa8498ff2995bc267172cbfd2273f8980/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:16:24Z","email":"aren@bransfer.io","name":"Aren"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:16:24Z","email":"aren@bransfer.io","name":"Aren"},"message":"feat: enhance swap transaction handling and gasless authorization\n\n- Refactor SwapDataProvider to manage wallet execution state with gasless preference.\n- Introduce getCurrentDepositActionIndex to identify the current deposit action index.\n- Update useDepositActionPolling to handle gasless authorization status and signature management.\n- Modify LayerSwapApiClient to include telemetry data for gasless authorization.\n- Extend widgetTelemetry to capture gasless authorization status in telemetry attributes.\n- Implement step transaction management in swapTransactionStore for better tracking of approval receipts.\n- Add tests for handling rejected signatures and ensuring approval receipts persist through retries.\n- Update withdrawal and wallet rejection tests to accommodate new transaction handling logic.","tree":{"sha":"bd625413b267ec2f517ec3af661bdbba12bb551d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/bd625413b267ec2f517ec3af661bdbba12bb551d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/795acf8aa8498ff2995bc267172cbfd2273f8980","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101871962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arentant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arentant","id":101871962,"login":"arentant","node_id":"U_kgDOBhJxWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user