?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/0f01b3e8f1b680903139dc90682110922b3e5db9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:05:36Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:05:36Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"message":"fix(balances): stop per-token balance re-requests and per-token error reports\n\nWhen an EVM multicall returned failed calls, every failed token was re-requested\nindividually and in parallel, each with the transport''s retries. Multicall\nfailures are almost always chunk-level RPC failures such as rate limits, so the\nfan-out turned one failing fetch of a large token list into hundreds of\nrequests against an RPC that was already rejecting us.\n\nEvery errored token balance was also reported through ErrorHandler on its own,\nalthough BalanceResolver already reports one BalanceResolverError per fetch\nlisting all failed tokens.\n\n- Failed multicall results stay failures and surface as a partial fetch.\n- resolveTokenBalanceFetchError only builds the errored balance; reporting is\n  left to BalanceResolver, once per fetch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f97cdeeae49776f4d8667a2de5e266b161422dc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/f97cdeeae49776f4d8667a2de5e266b161422dc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/0f01b3e8f1b680903139dc90682110922b3e5db9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/0f01b3e8f1b680903139dc90682110922b3e5db9","node_id":"C_kwDOGCnBrtoAKDBmMDFiM2U4ZjFiNjgwOTAzMTM5ZGM5MDY4MjExMDkyMmIzZTVkYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/b4a1e418d01b1a2a8aed9cc846337a77723dbcd1","sha":"b4a1e418d01b1a2a8aed9cc846337a77723dbcd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/b4a1e418d01b1a2a8aed9cc846337a77723dbcd1"}],"sha":"0f01b3e8f1b680903139dc90682110922b3e5db9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/0f01b3e8f1b680903139dc90682110922b3e5db9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/de81cb418a0aa915604876e5ac3d00d4cc43a849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:05:09Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:05:09Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"message":"fix(bridge): cut Faro telemetry volume to failures and first reports\n\nBrowser telemetry was dominated by low-signal records: request spans for every\nfetch (mostly third-party RPCs), every successful balance read, full viem\nstacks and calldata in each diagnostic, and third-party console warnings.\n\n- Request spans (faro.tracing.* events and trace items) are sent only for\n  failed requests to first-party origins: the page origin, NEXT_PUBLIC_LS_API\n  and NEXT_PUBLIC_FARO_TRACE_PROPAGATION_URLS.\n- Successful balance_fetch operations are not captured; failed and partial\n  ones are. Host onTelemetry handlers still receive every event.\n- widget_diagnostic sends the first line of the message and cause without\n  stacks, and each distinct diagnostic once per page load.\n- Deployed builds capture console errors only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e55e4fd2127b36b8ea00b598e0274ca17217f684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/e55e4fd2127b36b8ea00b598e0274ca17217f684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/de81cb418a0aa915604876e5ac3d00d4cc43a849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/de81cb418a0aa915604876e5ac3d00d4cc43a849","node_id":"C_kwDOGCnBrtoAKGRlODFjYjQxOGEwYWE5MTU2MDQ4NzZlNWFjM2QwMGQ0Y2M0M2E4NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/b4a1e418d01b1a2a8aed9cc846337a77723dbcd1","sha":"b4a1e418d01b1a2a8aed9cc846