pp/commit/6da6c924b9b72131745debab59f834e548d56411","sha":"6da6c924b9b72131745debab59f834e548d56411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/6da6c924b9b72131745debab59f834e548d56411"}],"sha":"af0ae512ee021957579d906fa0d62e1e4bcfb061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/af0ae512ee021957579d906fa0d62e1e4bcfb061"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/95d95a1ed9317ddd4314d855aafbca11b7700b6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:31:21Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:31:21Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"message":"fix(widget): report gasless authorization API failures as their own step\n\nA gasless deposit can fail at the wallet (signing) or at Layerswap''s API\n(the authorization is refused, or refreshing an expired one fails). Both\nwere reported as wallet_action_failed on stage wallet_action, which\ninflated the wallet-failure funnel. API failures now emit the new\ngasless_authorization_failed step on stage input_transfer, and the re-sign\nafter expiry emits its own wallet_prompt_opened. The gasless-unavailable\nfallback is unchanged.\n\nThe Grafana Transfer step queries and the blocked-or-failed alert include\nthe new step (regenerated with the repo''s generators).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5bd9b4c028f1af5e8edbc0aff8af4db1d9037cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/e5bd9b4c028f1af5e8edbc0aff8af4db1d9037cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/95d95a1ed9317ddd4314d855aafbca11b7700b6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/layerswap/layerswapapp/commit/95d95a1ed9317ddd4314d855aafbca11b7700b6d","node_id":"C_kwDOGCnBrtoAKDk1ZDk1YTFlZDkzMTdkZGQ0MzE0ZDg1NWFhZmJjYTExYjc3MDBiNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/layer