ps://api.github.com/users/babkenmes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/commits/35150846e1eab92d97612f3bca4c92404be8a1a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:17:15Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:17:15Z","email":"mesropyan.b@gmail.com","name":"babkenmes"},"message":"fix(bridge): record phase outcomes only for swaps the page watched\n\nonSwapLifecycle phase steps and onSwapComplete also fire when a finished\nswap is opened from a URL or history, so reloading /swap/<id> re-sent\nswap_completed/swap_failed to Faro. The legacy recorder now records\ntransitions (swap creation, API status changes) for any swap, but phase\nobservations and onSwapComplete only for swaps this page watched.\n\nThe watching steps move to @layerswap/widget-types as\nSWAP_LIFECYCLE_TRACKING_STEPS so the widget''s status baselining and the\nbridge recorder share one definition.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c98afb53c17e9f4d854f82a2401b7fcf14ae3bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/trees/c98afb53c17e9f4d854f82a2401b7fcf14ae3bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/layerswap/layerswapapp/git/commits/35150846e1eab92d97612f3bca4c92404be8a1a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28057877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babkenmes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babkenmes","id":28057877,"login":"babkenmes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU3ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.gi